                <p>Source: Eisenhower Library, Dulles Papers, General Memoranda of Conversation. Top
                    Secret; Personal and Private. Drafted by Dulles on August 24. The source text bears a handwritten
                    marginal inscription that reads: “MacArthur, Rountree has
